  <section class="hide-header" id="jinja">
<h1>Jinja<a class="headerlink" href="#jinja" title="Link to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<a class="reference internal image-reference" href="_images/jinja-name.svg"><img alt="_images/jinja-name.svg" class="align-center" src="_images/jinja-name.svg" style="height: 200px;" />
</a>
<p>Jinja is a fast, expressive, extensible templating engine. Special
placeholders in the template allow writing code similar to Python
syntax. Then the template is passed data to render the final document.</p>
